=== file: README.md ===
# Recipe shopping list

This Loom workflow turns recipe text into a structured shopping list grouped by aisle. It combines quantities only when the ingredient identity and units can be confidently reconciled; uncertain entries stay separate and are flagged. Ingredients without a clear aisle go under `Other`.

The workflow only returns the list. It does not modify an external shopping app.

## Files

- `main.loom` defines the workflow, structured output, calculator access, four-iteration agent limit, and run budget.
- `prompts/shopping-list.md` contains the agent instructions.
- `tests/main.test.yaml` covers the planned workflow cases.
- `eval/golden/ListBuilder.yaml` provides evaluation examples.

Run `weave check main.loom` to validate the script and `weave test main.loom` to run the scripted workflow tests.
=== end===
